<main class="container section"><div class="section-head"><span class="number">03 / ABOUT</span><h2>A practical approach to technology.</h2></div><p class="intro">I'm Yurian, a software engineer and independent product builder based in Tanzania. I work across web development, business systems, automation and digital products.</p><div class="notes"><div class="note"><h3>Build</h3><p>I turn ideas into working software, from interface to database and deployment.</p></div><div class="note"><h3>Learn</h3><p>I enjoy understanding how systems work and improving them through iteration.</p></div><div class="note"><h3>Ship</h3><p>Production matters. A project is useful when people can actually use it reliably.</p></div></div></main>